274 0 obj
  << /ActualText (6 August 2026\n\nDr\056 Sarah Mitchell\nDepartment of Cardiology\nSt\056 James Medical Center\n45 Greenfield Avenue\054 Cape Town\054 8001\n\nDear Dr\056 Mitchell\054\n\nRe\072 Referral of Patient \024 James R\056 Thompson \050DOB\072 14\05703\0571985\051\n\nI am writing to refer the above\055named patient for further evaluation and management of suspected cardiac arrhythmia\056 Mr\056 Thompson has been under my care for the past three years and recently presented with recurring palpitations\054 dizziness\054 and shortness of breath on exertion\056\n\nAn ECG performed on 28 July 2026 revealed intermittent irregular rhythms suggestive of atrial fibrillation\056 Blood pressure remains within normal limits \050128\05782 mmHg\051\054 and baseline blood work including thyroid function and electrolytes returned unremarkable results\056\n\nI would greatly appreciate your expert opinion and any diagnostic workup you deem appropriate\054 including a Holter monitor or echocardiogram\056 Enclosed please find his recent ECG tracing and laboratory results\056\n\nMr\056 Thompson is aware of this referral and available at your earliest convenience\056\n\nKind regards\054)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 275 0 R
     /Pg 270 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

